window.EN={"1":"※If Fae survived, and the Sword of Seals dealt the finishing blow","2":"Eek!","3":"Wh-what's this!? The building's starting to collapse!","4":"Everyone, hurry! Let's get out of here!","5":"Big Brother Roy...","6":"I know.","7":"Leave the rest to me! Now, hurry!!","8":"Oh! Lord Roy! You're safe!!","9":"Yeah, somehow.","10":"But I was surprised, when it suddenly started to collapse like that...","11":"It's a building already over a thousand years old, after all.","12":"It probably couldn't withstand the power of the \"Dragon-Devil\" and the \"Divine Weapons.\"","13":"I see...","14":"It's another sign of the changing of the times, I suppose.","15":"...Now then, Lord Roy? Just who might that person be, carried on your back...?","16":"Ah, this person?","17":"Marinas, actually, there's a favor I'd like to ask of you...","18":"※If Fae died, or the Sword of Seals did not deal the finishing blow ※Only if the Sword of Seals dealt the finishing blow","19":"Wh-what's this... the building's starting to collapse!","20":"Everyone, hurry! Let's get out of here!","21":"※Only if the Sword of Seals dealt the finishing blow","22":"Oh, Lord Roy, you're safe!","23":"Yeah, somehow.","24":"But I was surprised, when it suddenly started to collapse like that...","25":"...It's a building already over a thousand years old.","26":"A battle using a vast amount of energy was fought within it...","27":"The building itself must not have been able to withstand it.","28":"I see...","29":"So with this, it's finally over, is it, Lord Roy.","30":"No.","31":"This isn't the end. From here on is where it truly begins.","32":"We have to restore the land and the people ravaged by war.","33":"There's so much that still needs to be done.","34":"The real fight starts now!","35":"※If support level between Roy and Lilina is A","36":"Roy, it's finally here, isn't it. Princess Guinevere's coronation ceremony.","37":"This is my first time seeing her in formal dress. I bet she's beautiful enough to leave you speechless.","38":"When I first met her, I was honestly surprised.","39":"That someone so beautiful could exist in this world.","40":"That's true.","41":"But Princess Guinevere—from here on, things are going to be hard for her.","42":"Eh?","43":"If she becomes queen of Bern now, through the power of the kingdom of Etruria,","44":"I think there's bound to be backlash from within Bern, no matter what.","45":"Oh, no...","46":"Some people will probably say that Princess Guinevere","47":"\"aimed for the throne and borrowed Etruria's strength for it,\" and she'll have to face voices like that.","48":"...But I'm sure Princess Guinevere can get through it.","49":"And someday, Bern will become a richer nation than ever before...","50":"Because she's that noble, that wise... and that strong a person.","51":"That's right. I believe that too.","52":"...Roy, what will you do from now on?","53":"Me? I'm going back to Pherae.","54":"I'm worried about my father's illness too, and I need to rebuild the land ravaged by war.","55":"That... I... I too...","56":"Eh?","57":"Eh? N-no, it's nothing.","58":"I see... so Roy's going back to Pherae...","59":"What about you, Lilina? You're going back to Ostia, right?","60":"...Yes, that's how it'll be. I have to take up my father's will.","61":"I'm glad that where Lilina's going home to is Ostia.","62":"...Why?","63":"Because, if it's Ostia, I can always go to pick you up, any time.","64":"Eh...","65":"Lilina, I don't know when it'll be, but,","66":"I will definitely, Lilina...","67":"...S-suddenly saying something like that, I'm not even mentally prepared...","68":"B-but, I've always... thought of you, Roy...","69":"Oh, the coronation ceremony is about to start.","70":"Lilina, let's hurry. We have to go congratulate Princess Guinevere!","71":"Ah, R-Roy... wait a moment...","72":"※If support level between Roy and Lilina is not A ※If the Sword of Seals dealt the finishing blow","73":"Princess, it's finally here, isn't it. The coronation ceremony.","74":"Yes...","75":"For me, from here on will be even more days of struggle.","76":"I'm sorry. For me, there was no other way but to borrow the strength of the kingdom of Etruria.","77":"I had no other means.","78":"No. I'm grateful to you, Lord Roy.","79":"It's true that many will likely say I","80":"\"aimed for the throne and borrowed Etruria's strength for it.\"","81":"Princess Guinevere...","82":"But right now, more than any of that, rebuilding Bern is what matters.","83":"I will work to make the people and the vassals understand, by reviving this nation.","84":"Even if it takes years, even decades, someday, surely...","85":"If there's anything I can help with, please tell me, anytime.","86":"Thank you. I may well ask you for that help, someday.","87":"More than that... Lord Roy...","88":"Eh?","89":"What will you do from here on? Will you stay with the Etrurian army as you are?","90":"No. I'll be returning to Pherae.","91":"I'm worried about my father's illness too, and I need to rebuild the land ravaged by war.","92":"I see. So you'll be returning to your homeland.","93":"How like you, Lord Roy... with your ability and achievements,","94":"you could aim for an even higher position within the kingdom of Etruria...","95":"I-I'm not suited for anything like that!","96":"Hee hee... Pherae's people are fortunate, then.","97":"Surely, in no time, it will become a land even richer than before...","98":"Princess, your Highness... no, Your Majesty...","99":"\"Guinevere\" is fine. What is it?","100":"Yes, Lady Guinevere, the preparations for the ceremony are complete!","101":"Understood. I'll come right away.","102":"Lord Roy, there's just one thing I'd like to ask, if I may.","103":"What is it?","104":"Did you... deal the finishing blow, to the \"Dragon-Devil\"?","105":".........Must I answer that?","106":"No... I think your not answering is itself the answer.","107":"※Only if the Sword of Seals did not deal the finishing blow","108":"Princess, it's finally here, isn't it. The coronation ceremony.","109":"Yes...","110":"For me, from here on will be even more days of struggle.","111":"I'm sorry. For me, there was no other way but to borrow the strength of the kingdom of Etruria.","112":"I had no other means.","113":"No. I'm grateful to you, Lord Roy.","114":"It's true that many will likely say I","115":"\"aimed for the throne and borrowed Etruria's strength for it.\"","116":"Princess Guinevere...","117":"But right now, more than any of that, rebuilding Bern is what matters.","118":"I will work to make the people and the vassals understand, by reviving this nation.","119":"Even if it takes years, even decades, someday, surely...","120":"If there's anything I can help with, please tell me, anytime.","121":"Thank you. I may well ask you for that help, someday.","122":"More than that... Lord Roy...","123":"Eh?","124":"What will you do from here on? Will you stay with the Etrurian army as you are?","125":"No. I'll be returning to Pherae.","126":"I'm worried about my father's illness too, and I need to rebuild the land ravaged by war.","127":"I see. So you'll be returning to your homeland.","128":"How like you, Lord Roy... with your ability and achievements,","129":"you could aim for an even higher position within the kingdom of Etruria...","130":"I-I'm not suited for anything like that!","131":"Hee hee... Pherae's people are fortunate, then.","132":"Surely, in no time, it will become a land even richer than before...","133":"Princess, your Highness... no, Your Majesty...","134":"\"Guinevere\" is fine. What is it?","135":"Yes, Lady Guinevere, the preparations for the ceremony are complete!","136":"Understood. I'll come right away.","137":"Lord Roy, would you accompany me?","138":"Eh? Me?","139":"Ever since I left Bern carrying the \"Fire Emblem,\"","140":"you've truly taken such good care of me, Lord Roy.","141":"That's why I want you, Lord Roy, to witness it.","142":"The moment I receive Bern's crown, and Bern begins to walk a new path...","143":"Understood. If I'll do, I'd be glad to.","144":"Then...","145":"To witness the start of a new Bern... no, a new era...","146":"※Only if Fae survived and the Sword of Seals dealt the finishing blow: And so, time flowed on...","147":"Oh, why, it's you, Lord Roy. It's been a while.","148":"I had business that brought me near here,","149":"so I took the chance to stop by.","150":"Fae will be glad too, I'm sure.","151":"I saw her just now, actually. She looks as lively as ever.","152":"These days she's able to go outside more often, which must be all the more reason for it.","153":"So, how is it going? The woman I left in your care.","154":"The technique that stole her \"heart\"—I have undone it, but...","155":"...I take it she still hasn't been able to return to how she was, then.","156":"Fae takes her out sometimes,","157":"but she never tries to do anything on her own.","158":"I see...","159":"...Lord Roy.","160":"We were aware that that girl had been captured by the \"dragons,\" and yet","161":"we did not go to help her... fearing that showing ourselves before them again","162":"would put our whole race in danger.","163":"Even now, I wonder whether that judgment was the right one.","164":".........","165":"Is this, too, because we've come to live alongside humans, I wonder?","166":"With that atonement in mind as well,","167":"I intend to give everything I have, in order to restore that girl's \"heart.\"","168":"...Please. I'm counting on you.","169":"If only there were even some \"sign\" that her feelings have stirred at all—","170":"crying, or laughing, something like that...","171":"And then, you know, and then—that's called a \"tree,\" you know!","172":"A \"tree\"...","173":"Yeah! And on that \"tree,\" there's this really, really delicious \"fruit\" that grows!","174":"A \"fruit\"?","175":"Look, look, up there, that one. And then, you know, if you shake the \"tree\" like this...","176":"Eek!","177":"*sniff* It hit my hand...","178":"...Heh.","179":"Eh... Big Sister, did you just laugh?","180":"...Laugh? Me?","181":"Yeah, just now, a \"heh\"!","182":"Yay! Big Sister laughed, she laughed~","183":"\"Laugh\"? Is this... \"laughing\"...?","184":"Fae's going to go tell Big Brother Roy! That Big Sister laughed!!","185":"The wind..."};
